unassigned_mobile_app_devices.description:
{count} Home Assistant Companion app device(s) have no area, so voice commands spoken to them won't be room-aware:

{devices}

Assign each to a room in Settings → Devices & Services → Devices → open the device → set its Area. Ted's voice features (thermostat, music, announcements, timers, and answers on the Assist-Response screen) use a device's area to know which room you mean.
